  "game": "sorcr_l2",
  "notes": "Sorcerer L-2 special award with direct public switch writes only. Two balls rest on ball ramp switches 29 and 30; a coin and the credit button start a game and the served ball is plunged. Four rounds each spell S-O-R-C-E-R-E-R on switches 9-16, roll over the top lanes, return lanes, lower and upper left/right lanes and both spinners, and complete and reset the 3-bank. The third spelling awards a credit (credit display 00 to 01), which shows what the ROM drives for a credit award. Run from an NVRAM initialized by one prior empty-NVRAM power-up.",
